      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIMES FLYING (1) has mixed form recently, finishing eighth (27.16) in a Free For All at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Better than latest and can atone here. CUT THE CORD (6) copped a check in the run and finished in the minors when third (30.26) in a Grade 5 at Launceston. Does go very well at this journey. Expected to feature. INSPECTOR FRANK (8) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 2 lengths (19.67) behind Lester Rhode at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Hard to beat again. AYLA ZORRO (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
